{"id":"wb-8-294","name":"塘下方大宗祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"塘下方大宗祠","text":"塘下方大宗祠是浙江省义乌市一座祠堂建筑，位于义乌市后宅街道塘下村。塘下方大宗祠始建于明嘉靖年间，复建于光绪二十四年（1898年），坐北朝南，分三进两廊，占地面积约2000平方米。2011年，塘下方大宗祠成为浙江省文物保护单位，2019年成为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A1%98%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E5%A4%A7%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":86783804,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783804","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/281a88f172b634a9f17c7ba0.jpg","title":"The_Memorial_Temple_for_the_Family_of_Fang_in_Tangxia_Village_23_2022-02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Memorial_Temple_for_the_Family_of_Fang_in_Tangxia_Village_23_2022-02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/The_Memorial_Temple_for_the_Family_of_Fang_in_Tangxia_Village_23_2022-02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​义乌后宅街道塘下村方大宗祠，前院。","width":320,"height":213},"editorialNotes":["根据对应公布名录及公布年份，更正百科文本中的批次笔误。"],"textScope":"body-excerpt"}